<title>USA: Wal-Mart May same-store sales up 4.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Wal-Mart May same-store sales up 4.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BENTONVILLE, Ark 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $8,633     $7,907	+9.2	 +4.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $34,700    $31,025     +11.8	 +6.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	  May 30.</p>
<p>    Full company name is		     Wal-Mart Stores Inc</p>
<p>Sales figures are for Wal-Mart Stores. Total company same-store sales were up 3.6 percent in May. Same-store sales for the Sam's Club division were up 1.8 percent in May.</p>
</text>
